approach|方法；接近|We need a new ___ to this problem.|2
appropriate|适当的，恰当的|Wear ___ clothes for the interview.|2
approve|批准；赞成|The board will ___ the budget tomorrow.|2
argue|争论；主张|They often ___ about money.|2
